usage: create_consensus_network.py [-h] -a STR [-k INT | -p FLOAT] -e STR -o
                                   STR [-s STR]

Create a consensus network based on SJARACNe bootstrap networks.

optional arguments:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  -a STR, --adjmat-dir STR
                        directory with adjacent matrix
  -k INT, --min-recurrence INT
                        minimum number of distinct bootstrap networks
                        containing an edge; default: 6
  -p FLOAT, --p-value FLOAT
                        deprecated legacy normal-approximation p-value
                        threshold; use --min-recurrence instead
  -e STR, --exp-mat STR
                        expression matrix file
  -o STR, --out-dir STR
                        output directory
  -s STR, --subnet STR  file with gene symbols of interest to build a subnet
